# The main screen with the test firmware: the machine, the device, the menu.
machine
say "^  TOS date \d{4}-\d\d-\d\d, GEMDOS \d" 100
say "^  RAM \d+ KB, free \d+ KB" 100
say "^Device:  test firmware v" 100
say "^  layout 1, build emumd" 100
say "^PASS  The test microfirmware answers" 100
say "^\[L\] Line test" 100
say "^\[S\] Save report" 100
say "^\[Q\] Quit" 100
nosay "^FAIL"
shot main
